sol:'Reversibility forces $\\frac{Q_c}{Q_h} = \\frac{T_c}{T_h}$ (entropy balance), so $\\eta = 1 - Q_c/Q_h = 1 - T_c/T_h$. No engine topology beats it between the same baths — the second law\'s hard ceiling, written in kelvins only.',
