sol:'Insert $P = nRT/V$: $T(nR/V) - nRT/V = 0$. Ideal-gas internal energy genuinely depends on temperature alone — Joule\'s free-expansion observation ($\\Delta T = 0$) elevated to a theorem via one Maxwell relation.',
