sol:'Integrate $dS = (dU + P\\,dV)/T$ along any convenient reversible path (entropy is a state function): warm first ($nC_V\\ln(T_2/T_1)$), then expand isothermally ($nR\\ln(V_2/V_1)$). The actual path taken by the gas is irrelevant — the ledger only reads endpoints.',
