sol:'Each swap replaces a variable by its conjugate: $H = U + PV$ trades $V$ for $P$ (isobaric calorimetry $\\Delta H = Q_P$); $F = U - TS$ trades $S$ for $T$; $G = F + PV$ does both (chemistry\'s phase-rule currency). d$G = -S\\,dT + V\\,dP$ and siblings each spawn a Maxwell relation.',
