sol:'Coexistence requires $g_1(T,P) = g_2(T,P)$ along the line; differentiating the equality and using $dg = -s\\,dT + v\\,dP$ per phase: $dP/dT = (s_2 - s_1)/(v_2 - v_1) = L/(T\\Delta V)$. Ice skating lore aside, this ONE equation maps every melting/boiling/sublimation line.',
