sol:'Write $S(T,V)$: $dS = (\\partial S/\\partial T)_V dT + (\\partial S/\\partial V)_T dV = \\frac{C_V}{T}dT + (\\partial P/\\partial T)_V dV$ (Maxwell from $F$), then multiply by $T$. Isothermal entropy change needs only the pressure\'s thermal slope — entirely measurable.',
