sol:'$(\\partial P/\\partial V)_T = 0$ and $(\\partial^{2}P/\\partial V^{2})_T = 0$ on $P = nRT/(V - nb) - an^{2}/V^{2}$: solving the pair gives $V_c = 3nb$; back-substitution yields $T_c = 8a/(27Rb)$ and $P_c = a/(27b^{2})$. The universal ratio $RT_c/(P_cV_c) = 8/3$ (i.e. $Z_c = 3/8$) is vdW\'s falsifiable fingerprint.',
