sol:'Phase coexistence demands equal chemical potentials: $\\mu_{\\text{liq}} = \\mu_{\\text{gas}}$ along the flat tie-line; integrating $\\oint V\\,dP = 0$ around the loop converts this into the equality of the two signed areas. The drawn horizontal is nature\'s verdict: the interval contracts out of existence as binodal endpoints.',
